{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Throw \ud83e\udd54 Catch \ud83e\udd54</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And... don't cry \ud83d\ude04</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Also don't fail I'd say</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Not So Hot Potato: 2025 Final Boss&quot;</strong> is NOT a punishing game but it can be a pain in a$$ sometimes to be totally honest. Don't worry much, just throw/catch (if you can) while you try to survive the traps and pushing forward. You may regret your decisions once you throw the potato or once you do a simple jump but it will be too late for sure... your <i>problem</i> really \ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, once you get there and finish it the relief will be <strong>priceless!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd54 Realistic potato physics (more or less)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c A journey from the ground to the clouds \u2014 maybe even space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Fail once and... just don't fail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6c Optional co-op to suffer together </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude24 Not-so-calm gameplay but it'll be fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114540/extras/8dbef3be3862ef45749562df76e2345e.poster.avif?t=1765119444\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114540/extras/8dbef3be3862ef45749562df76e2345e.webm?t=1765119444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traps</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may get slaughtered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may burn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may rage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may scream</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may cry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">You may suffer (Probably)</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you'll enjoy it all, don't worry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114540/extras/e99fea8d5001b15f7dbc9c6fd96a0e21.poster.avif?t=1765119444\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114540/extras/e99fea8d5001b15f7dbc9c6fd96a0e21.webm?t=1765119444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be just one map for now, if you finish this one successfuly I promise I will add more maps lol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't give up and don't forget sky's the limit. Don't question your life decisions, enjoy the game instead :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114540/extras/a614fa8eb1cc5bcaee0fded08c34e702.avif?t=1765119444\" width=95 height=123 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Y'all made it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114540/9a7720f302000e4d03d473285775e4